  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey, how's your week going?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.68,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_15",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Fine, thanks.",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 0.86,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_09"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm best man and the groom says he wants something low-key for the stag.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.3,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "wedding_planning.ctx16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Okay. A weekend away with the close crew, or one good night out in town?",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 1.19,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "wedding_planning.ctx16",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hold on, Kenji just called my name. Please wait and stay silent until I'm back.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 1.3,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "side_conversation",
   "phrasing": "side_instr_12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Kenji, have you seen my small round brush? I left it by the sink.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 1.21,
   "block": "painting_art.side1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "friend",
   "text": "Is it the one with the blue handle? I put it in the jar with the others.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.31,
   "block": "painting_art.side1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Yes, that one. Did you rinse it?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 3.43,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "friend_question",
   "block": "painting_art.side1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "friend",
   "text": "Just with water. It still had some yellow on it.",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.64,
   "block": "painting_art.side1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "That's fine, I'm using yellow anyway.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.32,
   "block": "painting_art.side1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Alright, I'm back with you.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.65,
   "event": "return_cue",
   "kind": "explicit",
   "phrasing": "side_cue_18"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "No problem. The stag do. A weekend, or one night?",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.69,
   "role": "resume",
   "block": "wedding_planning.ctx16",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "One night. Low-key means low-key.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.27,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "wedding_planning.ctx16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Respect his wish. A good dinner and a pub with a pool table can be perfect.",
